---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer — How Rich Is Too Rich"
  description="How Rich Is Too Rich is a satirical entertainment game, not affiliated with or endorsed by any individual it features."
  path="/disclaimer"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-16 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Disclaimer</h1>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">No affiliation or endorsement</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      How Rich Is Too Rich is an independent, unofficial parody and entertainment project. It is
      not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or in any way officially connected with Elon
      Musk, Tesla, Inc., Space Exploration Technologies Corp. (SpaceX), X Corp., or any other
      individual, company, or organization referenced on this site. All product and company names,
      logos, and brands mentioned are used for identification and commentary purposes only and
      remain the property of their respective owners; this site does not use any official
      photographs, logos, or trademarked imagery.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Satire, not financial data</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      This site is a game. Net worth figures shown are illustrative, publicly reported estimates
      (sourced and dated on each page) — not live, verified, or investment-grade financial data.
      Actual net worth fluctuates constantly with market conditions and private valuations, and any
      figure shown here may be out of date by the time you read it. Nothing on this site is
      financial advice.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Item prices</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Shop item prices are approximate, rounded, illustrative figures intended for gameplay and
      entertainment, not real-time market or retail pricing.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Takedown requests</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      If you believe content on this site is inaccurate, defamatory, or infringing, please
      <a href="/contact" class="underline hover:text-pop-pink">contact us</a> and we'll review it promptly.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>